ClaimFeesIntegrationConcreteTest
├── When the locker is staked
│   └── It should revert with {Staked}
└── When the locker is not staked
    ├── When the amount of fees is zero
    │   ├── It should keep the same locker balance
    │   └── It should keep the same user balance
    └── When the amount of fees is greater than zero
        ├── When the beneficiary is address zero
        │   ├── It should claim the fees
        │   ├── It should send the fees to the recipient
        │   └── It should emit a {FeesClaimed} for the recipient
        └── When the beneficiary is not address zero
            ├── When beneficiary share is zero
            │   ├── It should claim the fees
            │   ├── It should send the fees to the recipient
            │   └── It should emit a {FeesClaimed} for the recipient
            └── When the beneficiary share is greater than zero
                ├── It should claim the fees
                ├── It should send a share to the beneficiary
                ├── It should emit a {FeesClaimed} for the beneficiary
                ├── It should send the fees to the recipient
                └── It should emit a {FeesClaimed} for the recipient
